         "classes": "elementor-element elementor-element-311ec7fc elementor-widget elementor-widget-react-heading",
         "wrapped": true,
         "html": "<div class=\"react-heading-here\">\n<span class=\"rt-sub-heading-here\">\n<em> Your adventure begins the moment you depart </em>\n</span>\n<h2 class=\"rt-title-here\">\n          Journey to Mocean Beach Resort     </h2>\n</div>"
        },
        {
         "type": "text-editor",
         "id": "2928cfbd",
         "classes": "elementor-element elementor-element-2928cfbd elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor",
         "wrapped": true,
         "html": "<p>Mocean Beach Resort is on Pantai Moro in West Sumbawa, one island east of Lombok. Most guests arrive one of two ways: a flight into Sumbawa Besar, or a ferry from Lombok to Poto Tano. We run private pickups from both. For every route from Bali, including the overland ferries and helicopter, see our <a href=\"/how-to-get-to-sumbawa/\">full guide to getting to Sumbawa</a>.</p>"
        }
