     "classes": "elementor-element elementor-element-59a0f9d5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading",
     "wrapped": true,
     "html": "<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Airport Pickup from Sumbawa Besar (SWQ)</h2>"
    },
    {
     "type": "image",
     "id": "4dd7e716",
     "classes": "elementor-element elementor-element-4dd7e716 has-jarallax-img rtimg-contain elementor-widget elementor-widget-image",
     "wrapped": true,
     "html": "<img alt=\"\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-16450\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"825\" src=\"/images/uploads/2025/09/transfer-3.jpg\" width=\"1650\"/>"
    },
    {
     "type": "text-editor",
     "id": "71d40363",
     "classes": "elementor-element elementor-element-71d40363 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor",
     "wrapped": true,
     "html": "<p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\">Begin your trip at Sultan Muhammad Kaharuddin III Airport (SWQ) in Sumbawa Besar, the main hub for reaching this side of the island. From here, Mocean offers a seamless private transfer service around 2 hours and 15 minutes of scenic driving through the stunning landscapes of West Sumbawa. The route is often highlighted in travel to Sumbawa Utama guides, known for its dramatic hillsides, winding coastal views, and untouched countryside. Along the way you’ll pass through traditional villages and lush greenery, giving you a glimpse of local life before arriving at the serene setting of Mocean Resort.</p>"
    }
   ]
  },
