      },
      {
       "type": "container",
       "id": "2ae35fe5",
       "classes": "elementor-element elementor-element-2ae35fe5 e-con-full e-flex rt-default-class e-con e-child",
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "react-heading",
         "id": "491a31e4",
         "classes": "elementor-element elementor-element-491a31e4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-react-heading",
         "wrapped": true,
         "html": "<div class=\"react-heading-here\">\n<span class=\"rt-sub-heading-here\">\n<em> Enjoy scenic island views as you arrive by boat </em>\n</span>\n<h2 class=\"rt-title-here\">\n          Ferry Pickup from Poto Tano     </h2>\n</div>"
        },
        {
         "type": "text-editor",
         "id": "22415fa5",
         "classes": "elementor-element elementor-element-22415fa5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor",
         "wrapped": true,
         "html": "<p data-end=\"600\" data-start=\"86\">If you prefer to travel by sea, you can arrive through Poto Tano, the ferry port linking Lombok with Sumbawa. The crossing offers scenic views of the surrounding islands, making the journey part of the adventure. From Poto Tano, it’s just a 30-minute car ride to Mocean Resort, ideal for guests arriving from Lombok or those enjoying an island-hopping itinerary. With ocean breezes and our team ready to welcome you, this route combines convenience with a memorable start to your stay.</p>"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
