     "id": "22fa33b",
     "classes": "elementor-element elementor-element-22fa33b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor",
     "wrapped": true,
     "html": "<p>Plan your arrival in advance to make your journey as smooth as possible. Check flight options into Sumbawa Besar Airport (SWQ) or review ferry schedules from Lombok to ensure you avoid unnecessary delays. For longer rides, it’s a good idea to pack a few essentials such as light snacks, bottled water, and sunscreen so you stay comfortable along the way. Don’t forget to share your exact arrival details with our team so transfers are arranged and waiting for you upon landing or docking. Whenever possible, aim to arrive during daylight hours, as it not only makes navigation easier but also allows you to take in the stunning island scenery right from the start. By preparing ahead, your first impression of Mocean Beach Resort will be relaxed, seamless, and truly memorable.</p>"
    }
